{"id": "holdout-health-head-001", "category": "holdout_semantic_memory", "runner": "baseline", "fault_injection": false, "session_id": "eval-holdout-health-head-001-2b5a7eb5", "family_id": "holdout-head-2b5a7eb5", "setup_members": [], "answer": "奶奶今天提到过头疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "tool_calls": [], "command_type": null, "trace_id": "98f86d69-b108-4baf-b03e-a0ebe2f7ba38", "latency_ms": 4339.21, "turns": [{"response": "哎呀，脑壳疼可不好受。您先坐下来歇一歇，喝点温水，找个安静的地方闭眼休息一会儿。\n\n如果疼得厉害，或者还伴有头晕、恶心这些不舒服的感觉，一定要赶紧跟家里人说说，或者联系医生看看。\n\n我这边只能给您生活上的提醒，可代替不了医生的诊断哦。您要是疼得厉害，千万别硬扛着。需要我帮您查查天气或者做点别的吗？", "session_id": "eval-holdout-health-head-001-2b5a7eb5-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 4.32681, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:47:15.257153", "trace_id": "691d23e2-ee9e-4bca-b6cc-c3629daf74a7"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "奶奶今天提到过头疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-holdout-health-head-001-2b5a7eb5-father", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.001501, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:47:15.262662", "trace_id": "98f86d69-b108-4baf-b03e-a0ebe2f7ba38"}, "reminder": null}], "storage_check": null, "harness_trace": []}
